  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Training & Optimization",
      "items": [
        "Configured 4096-token clean windows. Source 83acb7cc6e3a597800cb6ae3be8ad673b100e6f3; configs/pretrain_a100_380m.yaml.",
        "Uniform corruption replaces tokens with random vocabulary entries under the cosine schedule; per-canvas t ~ U{1..16}.",
        "Vocab-chunk CE width 4096 at B=16. Memory figures are arithmetic, not measured allocations."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Architecture & Inference",
      "items": [
        "Attention is causal across canvases and bidirectional within; FlexAttention on GPU, SDPA elsewhere (models/transformer.py:DiffusionGemma._build_mask).",
        "Canvas time embedding is added to token embeddings inside the backbone, not to corrupted tokens (models/transformer.py:DiffusionGemma._add_canvas_time).",
        "Sampler commits unchanged-or-stronger positions; finalized canvases are re-encoded with a full-visibility decode view and appended to the KV cache."
      ]
    }
